@DrNadolsky here’s the abstract:

338-OR Tirzepatide Reduces Appetite, Energy Intake, and Fat Mass in People with T2D

This randomized, double-blind, parallel study compared the effects of TZP 15 mg (N=45), semaglutide (SEMA) 1 mg (N=44) and placebo (PBO) (N=28) on energy intake

NICE recommends weight loss drug semaglutide for obese adults https://t.co/GydxNPECty

clinical trial of just under 2000 volunteers found that those lost on average 👇12% more weight than those who had only coaching in weight loss

